-- 2b. TERM-BY-TERM COMPLEX DIFFERENTIATION, DISK RE-EXPANSION, IDENTITY THEOREM,
--     AND ZERO-MULTIPLICITY LOG-DERIVATIVE POLE DECOMPOSITION (0 AXIOMS!)
